<title>USA: Ryerson Tull completes Cardinal acquisition.</title>
<headline>Ryerson Tull completes Cardinal acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ryerson Tull Inc said Thursday it completed its acquisition of Cardinal Metals Inc, a distributor and processor of carbon steel products.</p>
<p>The purchase price was not disclosed.</p>
<p>Cardinal had 1996 sales of $23 million.</p>
<p>Ryerson Tull distributes and processes metals. It is 87 percent owned by Inland Steel Industries Inc.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
